1. [MAJOR] tests/bootstrap_ship_test.rs:740 — upload-once test counts `text.matches(path)` over the whole file and never asserts the `if: matrix.upload_compiler` gate is used — removing the gate while keeping the matrix defs stays green while both legs upload twice, and count==1 held even before the fix since one step runs per leg — assert the `if:` line exists on the compiler upload step and count `files:` occurrences, not whole-file substring matches
